{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"推出 (一种余极限)"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"推出"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>推出是以\n$$\r\n\\bullet \\leftarrow \\bullet \\rightarrow \\bullet\r\n$$\n为指标范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":", 是"},{"Local":{"url":"拉回","text":"拉回"}},{"Plain":"的对偶.</p>\n"}]}}